  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> satisfy the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the minimum value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> will be"
  },
